<title>SOUTH KOREA: Chong Kun Dang '96 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Chong Kun Dang '96 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>	 (billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)			2,001     vs	724</p>
<p>    Net profit			5.67     vs     2.05</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  8.23     vs     3.85</p>
<p>    Turnover			179.96     vs   138.02</p>
<p>Dividend (pct, par 5,000 won)</p>
<p>	in cash			 13.0     vs     10.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Chong Kun Dang Corp, a pharmaceutical firm, said its 1996 share capital was unchanged at 2.84 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5644</p>
</text>
